{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-65",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Source spatial co-direction illustration: h1, h2 and h3 rise from three distinct origins on an oblique plane. This projection asserts direction and incidence only, not perpendicularity, rectangleness, equal lengths or exhaustive relative-position classification.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/a07e/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-65.png",
      "sha256": "3eca7c34248a5a98b6c02cf830ffc13fd8edaf24a989c3b19d84db5502d23a86"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n16",
        "text": "与平面上的情况一样，空间中射线同方向的关系具有反身性：\n$h\\uparrow\\uparrow h$。\n它具有对称性：如果$h_1\\uparrow\\uparrow h_2$，那么$h_2\\uparrow\\uparrow h_1$。\n\n它也具有传递性：如果$h_1\\uparrow\\uparrow h_2$和$h_2\\uparrow\\uparrow h_3$，那么$h_1\\uparrow\\uparrow h_3$（图65）。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n16",
        "text": "所有与同一条射线方向相同的射线组成的集合，叫做空间中的一个方向。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "geo910-c1-s2-n16",
        "text": "任意一条射线都完全确定了与它同方向的全体射线组成的集合。\n因此，以后用一条射线来给出空间中的一个方向。"
      }
    ],
